.git
.gitignore
build/
dist/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
# Build output and caches that .gitignore already keeps out of the repository. They are not
# in the image either way - nothing copies them - but everything here is uploaded to the
# daemon as the build context before the first instruction runs, and these are the large
# ones: node_modules/ and editors/vscode/out/ from working on the extension, htmlcov/ and
# .coverage from a coverage run, the packaged extension, the built documentation, and the
# two ASAP2 specification pdfs under the design records.
node_modules/
editors/vscode/out/
*.vsix
htmlcov/
.coverage
coverage.xml
coverage.json
docs/_build/
docs/superpowers/*.pdf
